{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"JOS","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"约书亚记","commonName":"约书亚记","title":"约书亚记","order":6,"numberOfChapters":24,"sha256":"9eb685769afd97937413dc8bd46c6ab5d21b53bc9e539bc2e909ca5de41a1ee6","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":24,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOS/24.json","totalNumberOfVerses":654},"chapter":{"number":20,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["避难城"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["耶和华对约书亚说："]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["“你吩咐以色列人，照我以前借摩西所吩咐你们的，设立一些城邑作为避难城，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["好让误杀人的可以逃到那里，躲避报血仇的人追杀。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["他要逃到避难城，站在城门口向城中的长老们陈明事情的经过，长老们就把他收容到城里，给他提供住处，让他留在那里。"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["如果报血仇的人追到，长老们不可把他交出来，因为他是无意杀的，跟被杀者无冤无仇。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他要住在城内，直到在会众面前受了审讯，并且还要等到在任的大祭司死后，才可离城回乡。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["于是，民众便设立拿弗他利山区加利利境内的基低斯、以法莲山区的示剑和犹大山区的基列·亚巴，即希伯仑作为避难城。"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["他们又在约旦河东岸、耶利哥东面空旷的平原上设立吕便支派的比悉，迦得支派基列境内的拉末和玛拿西支派巴珊境内的哥兰作为避难城。"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["这是为以色列人和那些从外地来寄居的人所设立的避难城，误杀了人的可以逃到那里，不致未在会众面前受审便死在报血仇的人手里。"]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOS/20.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOS/21.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/JOS/19.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":9}